{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2190", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2190/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2190/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2190/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2190", "id": 2028893074, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s547nOS", "number": 2190, "title": "unix_epoch_time subscription not working in C++ and Python ", "user": {"login": "LarsLeferenz", "id": 37025379, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDI1Mzc5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37025379?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/LarsLeferenz", "html_url": "https://github.com/LarsLeferenz", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LarsLeferenz/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LarsLeferenz/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LarsLeferenz/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LarsLeferenz/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LarsLeferenz/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LarsLeferenz/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LarsLeferenz/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LarsLeferenz/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LarsLeferenz/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 3, "created_at": "2023-12-06T16:02:56Z", "updated_at": "2024-05-20T04:15:43Z", "closed_at": "2024-05-20T04:15:43Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hello, \r\n\r\nI'm currently trying to sync time between an external application and my mavlink device in C++. To do this I'm trying to subscribe to the \"unix_epoch_time\" telemetry.\r\nSadly, the callback is never called. To explore the issue, I also created a simple python script to display the telemetry message:\r\n```python\r\nimport asyncio\r\nfrom mavsdk import System\r\n\r\nasync def run():\r\n    # Connect to the MAVSDK system\r\n    system = System(mavsdk_server_address='localhost', port=50051)\r\n    await system.connect()\r\n\r\n    await system.telemetry.set_rate_unix_epoch_time(1)\r\n    # Subscribe to time updates\r\n    async for time in system.telemetry.unix_epoch_time():\r\n        print(f\"Time: {time}\")\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    asyncio.run(run())\r\n```\r\nPython isn't outputting anything. The Mavsdk server output is as follows:\r\n```\r\nPS C:\\Users\\Lars\\Downloads> .\\mavsdk_server_win32.exe -p 50051 serial://COM5:57600\r\n[04:46:05|Info ] MAVSDK version: v1.4.17 (D:\\a\\MAVSDK\\MAVSDK\\src\\mavsdk\\core\\mavsdk_impl.cpp:20)\r\n[04:46:05|Info ] Waiting to discover system on serial://COM5:57600... (D:\\a\\MAVSDK\\MAVSDK\\src\\mavsdk_server\\src\\connection_initiator.h:20)\r\n[04:46:05|Debug] New: System ID: 1 Comp ID: 1 (D:\\a\\MAVSDK\\MAVSDK\\src\\mavsdk\\core\\mavsdk_impl.cpp:496)\r\n[04:46:05|Debug] Component Autopilot (1) added. (D:\\a\\MAVSDK\\MAVSDK\\src\\mavsdk\\core\\system_impl.cpp:377)\r\n[04:46:05|Warn ] Vehicle type changed (new type: 2, old type: 0) (D:\\a\\MAVSDK\\MAVSDK\\src\\mavsdk\\core\\system_impl.cpp:225)\r\n[04:46:05|Debug] Discovered 1 component(s) (D:\\a\\MAVSDK\\MAVSDK\\src\\mavsdk\\core\\system_impl.cpp:578)\r\n[04:46:05|Info ] System discovered (D:\\a\\MAVSDK\\MAVSDK\\src\\mavsdk_server\\src\\connection_initiator.h:63)\r\n[04:46:05|Info ] Server started (D:\\a\\MAVSDK\\MAVSDK\\src\\mavsdk_server\\src\\grpc_server.cpp:53)\r\n[04:46:05|Info ] Server set to listen on 0.0.0.0:50051 (D:\\a\\MAVSDK\\MAVSDK\\src\\mavsdk_server\\src\\grpc_server.cpp:54)\r\n```\r\n\r\nI also looked into the mavlink messages through QGroundControl and I am receiving SYSTEM_TIME and TIME_SYNC messages:\r\n![image](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/assets/37025379/a0c608df-fd3e-4bc4-8e1e-6f7f240e3548)\r\n\r\nMy FC is a Cube Orange running PX4 v1.14 connected via USB. I'm using mavsdk-python 1.4.9., mavsdk-server 1.4.17 and I my C++ solution utilized v1.4.16.\r\n\r\nI should also mention that I don't have a GPS connected at the moment.\r\n\r\nAm I using unix_epoch_time wrong or do I have to set a parameter in PX4 perhaps?\r\n\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2190/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/re